WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.606 --> 00:00:10.759
Blue: not booked yet.
Purple: booked, but changed since.

2
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:17.761
“Annað”: TermTime’s placeholder room – it
can be booked. This one has no room.

3
00:00:17.861 --> 00:00:24.763
“Bóka allt”: everything the course needs,
from what the calendar shows.

4
00:00:24.863 --> 00:00:30.765
Bóka: the unbooked sessions,
each with room, time and weeks.

5
00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:35.766
Uppfæra bókun: the purple one,
and what changed.

6
00:00:35.866 --> 00:00:40.767
Sleppt (skipped), with the reason –
here: no room.

7
00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:46.770
One at a time, with progress –
if one fails, the rest go on.

8
00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:52.918
A summary at the end, then the course
is read back from TermTime.

9
00:00:53.018 --> 00:00:58.919
All green but the one with no room –
choose a room and book it (1c).
